          <Text style={{ fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#64748B' }}>3 skipped</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ width: 88, height: 4, borderRadius: 2, background: '#F59E0B' }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>
          0.5.0 全量回归口径：含既有阶段、week2 回归与 Phase 4/5 治理用例；3 项 Java 专用集成未在该命令启用
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>
            <span style={{ color: '#F59E0B' }}>383 → 457 → 495</span>：同一套回归随阶段扩容
          </Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>不是三次独立测试集，各阶段数字不重复相加</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
