          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>必须显式启用；报告逐用例记录是否实际执行，跳过不算通过</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>REQ-001–049 / AC 追踪报告</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>关联用例 ≠ 全部需求交付；证据形态 = validation.json + JUnit XML + 单 Run 导出</Text>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ height: 84, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 10, padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4 }}>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 18.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>安装包逐字节一致</Text>
          <Text style={{ fontSize: 14.5, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.45 }}>42 / 51 个 Python 模块与源码一致，pip check 与差异格式检查通过</Text>
        </Box>
